SurgePlugin (engine/surge/) compiles the core of Surge XT
(https://github.com/surge-synthesizer/surge), fetched at build time, which is
licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 — the licence of this
project. Copyright the Surge Synth Team and contributors.
